## Evidence-status note

The peer-reviewed evidence cited above supports the direction of the recommendations, but not every intervention has direct evidence of reducing UK winter A&E attendances. Before using this synthesis as a systematic review or publication-ready evidence table, all references should be checked in PubMed, Scopus or the Cochrane Library, and the evidence should be updated to the precise search end-date. In particular, references for virtual wards, urgent community response, same-day emergency care, social prescribing and outpatient treatment pathways require condition- and model-specific verification.